Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 17:02:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(cart): fetch the cart after each change, not with an
 earlier change's request

Two cart changes close together (the quantities of two lines, or a
quantity and a remove) each fetch the cart again when their request is
done. urql gives a query the result of an identical one already in flight,
so the second change could get the first change's fetch, answered before
the second change reached the server: the page kept that line's old price
and the old totals. syncCartWithServer now starts each fetch once the one
before it has finished.
