Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 17:02:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(checkout): keep the shipping methods of the latest
 quote

Checkout re-quotes the shipping methods 800 ms after each change of the
address. When the address changed again while a quote was on the way and
the older quote answered last, its methods replaced the newer ones (a
Canadian address listed the United States methods). Only the latest
quote's answer is kept now.
